{"id":"ch-a3f4e24e754e","html":"<div class=\"prose\">  <span class=\"source-page\" style=\"background-color:#7f8f7c;color:inherit\"> <span class=\"source-ink\" style=\"color:#ffffff\">    <span class=\"dropcap\"><span class=\"strong\">街</span></span>道上传来男孩的脚步声。那脚步声，是细碎的——却足以吓退草丛中驻足的一只猫；猫转过头来。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>男孩看着那只橘黄猫的纺锤形瞳孔——他猛地瞧见里面站着一个人。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">是我自己吗？</span>他探下身，伸手向那只猫挥了一挥。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫不作声，却也不动。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>男孩扭头看向四周；行人们都自顾自地走着。他们的无聊反衬着男孩对这只猫的好奇。他伸手从自己拿着的纸袋中掏出一块面包，撕成一块块，开始逗起了猫——他并不知道猫对面包感不感兴趣。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫出乎意料地从草丛走出，前脚掌撑在街道的粗糙水泥地上，低头嗅了嗅那些面包屑，却并不吃，抬头望向了男孩。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫抬头的瞬间，仿佛像见过男孩一般，飞也似地跳到了男孩的怀里，和他相拥。男孩笑着，轻轻抚摸着它的头，听它在怀里小声咆哮。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>他们在街道上漫游着。猫似乎特别不喜欢刺眼的阳光，把头扭了过去，对着男孩的胸脯。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>此时，男孩看到远处一个四处张望的女孩。他本想帮忙；可是一想到繁重的课务，他便又烦恼起来，无心顾她。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>但他也并没有故意避开女孩，而是从她身旁经过。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>女孩依旧张望着；看到男孩经过，她便停了下来，进而看到他怀里的橘猫。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">小木？你怎么在这里？</span>她探头问着。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>猫转过头来；它见到这个女孩，便开始两眼放光，伸出前脚，开始不断地撒娇。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">感谢你把它找回来——真的非常谢谢你；它是我养的，在外面已经迷路了三天了；</span>女孩从男孩手里接过猫。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">不用谢；</span>男孩笑着说。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">我觉得你有点眼熟……你叫什么名字呀？</span>那个女孩和男孩对视着，问道。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">叫我伊藤佐一就好；</span>男孩淡定地回答着，但心里已经泛起一丝紧张；他感到了一丝耳鸣声。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">你呢？</span>伊藤佐一强忍疼痛，反过来问道。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">我叫铃木和子——我应该是和你同班的吧？</span>女孩问道。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>伊藤佐一这才回忆起这一事实。他突然想起了一些什么。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">不如我们一起去河边散散步吧？</span>铃木和子提议道。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>……<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>河边，两人正迎着岸边的风，看着岸边的浪。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>粉紫色花瓣遍布他们的脚下。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>伊藤佐一把手搭在了石护栏上。他仿佛早已下定了某种决心。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">真美啊；</span>铃木和子看着白色的浪花泡沫，伸出双手，仿佛想要隔着河堤与它们互动。她突然感到一阵伤感——只因这一切，曾是那么似曾相识。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>而伊藤佐一，早已把什么，悄悄扔进了河里。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span></span></div>"}